{
  "id": "E339",
  "title": "Please Give Me a Bag",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2019-07-04",
  "synopsis": "How do you ask for a bag when you go shopping?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1089/380488ac148493ae6abaf49bcb9ee44f1b60f5fd.mp3?1561665482",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "请给我一个袋子\n\n售货员：你好，一共二十块。微信还是支付宝？\n本：支付宝，谢谢！可以给我一个袋子吗？\n售货员：袋子五毛钱一个。\n本：好的，没问题。谢谢！",
    "traditional": "請給我一個袋子\n\n售貨員：你好，一共二十塊。微信還是支付寶？\n本：支付寶，謝謝！可以給我一個袋子嗎？\n售貨員：袋子五毛錢一個。\n本：好的，沒問題。謝謝！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Please Give Me a Bag"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "售货员：你好，一共二十块。微信还是支付宝？",
      "traditional": "售貨員：你好，一共二十塊。微信還是支付寶？",
      "pinyin": "shòu huò yuán nǐ hǎo yí gòng èr shí kuài wēi xìn hái shi zhī fù bǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop assistant: Hello, 20 kuai altogether. WeChat or Alipay?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "本：支付宝，谢谢！可以给我一个袋子吗？",
      "traditional": "本：支付寶，謝謝！可以給我一個袋子嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn zhī fù bǎo xiè xie kě yǐ gěi wǒ yí ge dài zi ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Alipay, thank you! Can I have a bag, please?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "售货员：袋子五毛钱一个。",
      "traditional": "售貨員：袋子五毛錢一個。",
      "pinyin": "shòu huò yuán dài zi wǔ máo qián yí ge",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Shop assistant: 5 mao for a bag."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "本：好的，没问题。谢谢！",
      "traditional": "本：好的，沒問題。謝謝！",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de méi wèn tí xiè xie",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok, no problem. Thank you!"
    }
  ],
